{
  "$schema": "https://schema.management.azure.com/schemas/2019-04-01/deploymentTemplate.json#",
  "contentVersion": "1.0.0.0",
  "metadata": {
    "comment": [
      "The thing that actually makes the agent run on a timer.",
      "",
      "Foundry routines look like the native answer and are declared in",
      "azure.yaml, but they do not fire: registered routines produced no runs",
      "over six days, and Application Insights showed agent activity only in the",
      "hours containing a manual invocation. Both routines therefore ship",
      "disabled, and this is the trigger the accelerator actually supports.",
      "docs/foundry/README.md records the evidence and the commands to",
      "reproduce it.",
      "",
      "Deploy once per enabled sweep with distinct names and parameters.",
      "Mailbox ingestion, semantic-health scans and pipeline triage are separate",
      "jobs with independently chosen cadences:",
      "",
      "  command='sweep'         every 5 minutes   drains the mailbox and runs",
      "                                            deferred retries",
      "  command='silent sweep'  hourly            runs the freshness, volume",
      "                                            and schema probes, which no",
      "                                            alert will ever tell you about",
      "  command='pipeline sweep' every 5 minutes  triages failed scheduled",
      "                                            pipelines and verifies reruns",
      "  command='command sweep' every minute     drains authenticated operator",
      "                                            investigations from SQL",
      "  command='heartbeat'    every minute     fairly drains durable monitoring",
      "                                            and human-command work",
      "",
      "The monitoring collector owns discovery/polling/event intake. Deploy one",
      "heartbeat for the controller rather than another polling timer per target.",
      "Create disabled, verify the identity and schema, then explicitly enable.",
      "",
      "Why a Logic App and not a Function or a VM cron: it authenticates with a",
      "system-assigned managed identity, so there is no key anywhere, which the",
      "tenant requires. It also keeps its own run history, so a failed sweep is",
      "visible after the fact rather than being a thing that quietly stopped.",
      "",
      "The HTTP timeout is PT15M. It must outlast the command worker's combined",
      "triage and approval budgets plus 30 seconds (300 + 300 + 30 by default).",
      "PT10M covered the approval window but not that combined deadline.",
      "A sweep requiring approval blocks while it waits for a human. At the earlier",
      "PT3M the scheduler killed the run BEFORE the approval window closed, so a",
      "person could approve inside the documented five minutes and find the work",
      "had already been abandoned. Keep the caller timeout above the full budget.",
      "",
      "The identity needs permission to invoke the agent. That grant is not in",
      "this template because it is a role assignment on the Foundry project,",
      "which is a different scope - see docs/DeploymentGuide.md."
    ]
  },
  "parameters": {
    "name": {
      "type": "string",
      "defaultValue": "bi-triage-scheduled-sweep",
      "metadata": {
        "description": "Deploy this template once per cadence, with a distinct name each time."
      }
    },
    "location": {
      "type": "string",
      "defaultValue": "[resourceGroup().location]"
    },
    "projectEndpoint": {
      "type": "string",
      "metadata": {
        "description": "e.g. https://<account>.services.ai.azure.com/api/projects/<project>"
      }
    },
    "agentName": {
      "type": "string",
      "defaultValue": "bi-triage-controller"
    },
    "command": {
      "type": "string",
      "defaultValue": "heartbeat",
      "allowedValues": [
        "sweep",
        "silent sweep",
        "pipeline sweep",
        "command sweep",
        "heartbeat"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "description": "Constrained on purpose. The controller routes anything it does not recognise to 'triage this text as an alert', so a typo here would not fail - it would quietly triage the word as if it were a Power BI alert."
      }
    },
    "frequency": {
      "type": "string",
      "defaultValue": "Minute",
      "allowedValues": [
        "Minute",
        "Hour",
        "Day"
      ]
    },
    "interval": {
      "type": "int",
      "defaultValue": 1,
      "minValue": 1
    },
    "enabled": {
      "type": "bool",
      "defaultValue": false,
      "metadata": {
        "description": "Enable only after the controller, durable schema and invocation identity are verified."
      }
    },
    "dataClassification": {
      "type": "string",
      "defaultValue": "Internal",
      "metadata": {
        "description": "Classification of the actual operational metadata; do not label real incidents synthetic."
      }
    },
    "alertWebhookUrl": {
      "type": "securestring",
      "defaultValue": "",
      "metadata": {
        "description": "Optional Teams incoming webhook. If set, a failed sweep posts here. Leave empty and failures are still visible in run history, but nothing announces them - which is how an outage went unnoticed until someone invoked the agent by hand."
      }
    },
    "owner": {
      "type": "string",
      "defaultValue": "unassigned",
      "metadata": {
        "description": "Tag value only. Set it to whoever should be asked before this is deleted."
      }
    },
    "costCenter": {
      "type": "string",
      "defaultValue": "unassigned",
      "metadata": {
        "description": "Tag value only. Your chargeback code."
      }
    },
    "environment": {
      "type": "string",
      "defaultValue": "evaluation",
      "metadata": {
        "description": "Tag value only, e.g. evaluation, test, production."
      }
    }
  },
  "variables": {
    "agentUri": "[concat(parameters('projectEndpoint'), '/agents/', parameters('agentName'), '/endpoint/protocols/openai/responses?api-version=v1')]",
    "foundryAudience": "https://ai.azure.com"
  },
  "resources": [
    {
      "type": "Microsoft.Logic/workflows",
      "apiVersion": "2019-05-01",
      "name": "[parameters('name')]",
      "location": "[parameters('location')]",
      "identity": {
        "type": "SystemAssigned"
      },
      "tags": {
        "CostCenter": "[parameters('costCenter')]",
        "Owner": "[parameters('owner')]",
        "Environment": "[parameters('environment')]",
        "DataClassification": "[parameters('dataClassification')]"
      },
      "properties": {
        "state": "[if(parameters('enabled'), 'Enabled', 'Disabled')]",
        "definition": {
          "$schema": "https://schema.management.azure.com/providers/Microsoft.Logic/schemas/2016-06-01/workflowdefinition.json#",
          "contentVersion": "1.0.0.0",
          "parameters": {
            "agentUri": {
              "type": "String",
              "defaultValue": "[variables('agentUri')]"
            },
            "foundryAudience": {
              "type": "String",
              "defaultValue": "[variables('foundryAudience')]"
            },
            "command": {
              "type": "String",
              "defaultValue": "[parameters('command')]"
            },
            "alertWebhookUrl": {
              "type": "SecureString",
              "defaultValue": "[parameters('alertWebhookUrl')]"
            }
          },
          "triggers": {
            "Every_interval": {
              "type": "Recurrence",
              "recurrence": {
                "frequency": "[parameters('frequency')]",
                "interval": "[parameters('interval')]"
              }
            }
          },
          "actions": {
            "Invoke_the_agent": {
              "type": "Http",
              "runAfter": {},
              "inputs": {
                "method": "POST",
                "uri": "@parameters('agentUri')",
                "headers": {
                  "Content-Type": "application/json"
                },
                "body": {
                  "input": "@{parameters('command')}"
                },
                "authentication": {
                  "type": "ManagedServiceIdentity",
                  "audience": "@parameters('foundryAudience')"
                },
                "retryPolicy": {
                  "type": "none"
                }
              },
              "limit": {
                "timeout": "PT15M"
              }
            },
            "Validate_agent_response": {
              "type": "ParseJson",
              "runAfter": {
                "Invoke_the_agent": [
                  "Succeeded"
                ]
              },
              "inputs": {
                "content": "@if(contains(body('Invoke_the_agent'), '$content'), json(base64ToString(body('Invoke_the_agent')['$content'])), body('Invoke_the_agent'))",
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "required": [
                    "status"
                  ],
                  "properties": {
                    "status": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "enum": [
                        "completed"
                      ]
                    },
                    "error": {
                      "type": "null"
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            },
            "Did_it_fail": {
              "type": "If",
              "runAfter": {
                "Invoke_the_agent": [
                  "Succeeded",
                  "Failed",
                  "TimedOut"
                ],
                "Validate_agent_response": [
                  "Failed",
                  "TimedOut",
                  "Skipped"
                ]
              },
              "expression": {
                "and": [
                  {
                    "not": {
                      "equals": [
                        "@empty(parameters('alertWebhookUrl'))",
                        true
                      ]
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              "actions": {
                "Announce_the_failure": {
                  "type": "Http",
                  "runAfter": {},
                  "inputs": {
                    "method": "POST",
                    "uri": "@parameters('alertWebhookUrl')",
                    "headers": {
                      "Content-Type": "application/json"
                    },
                    "body": {
                      "type": "message",
                      "attachments": [
                        {
                          "contentType": "application/vnd.microsoft.card.adaptive",
                          "content": {
                            "$schema": "http://adaptivecards.io/schemas/adaptive-card.json",
                            "type": "AdaptiveCard",
                            "version": "1.4",
                            "body": [
                              {
                                "type": "TextBlock",
                                "size": "Medium",
                                "weight": "Bolder",
                                "color": "Attention",
                                "text": "Scheduled sweep failed"
                              },
                              {
                                "type": "TextBlock",
                                "wrap": true,
                                "text": "The agent did not return a confirmed result. Work may have executed; review run history and target state before retrying."
                              },
                              {
                                "type": "FactSet",
                                "facts": [
                                  {
                                    "title": "Schedule",
                                    "value": "@{workflow()['name']}"
                                  },
                                  {
                                    "title": "Command",
                                    "value": "@{parameters('command')}"
                                  },
                                  {
                                    "title": "Status",
                                    "value": "@{outputs('Invoke_the_agent')?['statusCode']}"
                                  },
                                  {
                                    "title": "When",
                                    "value": "@{utcNow()}"
                                  }
                                ]
                              }
                            ]
                          }
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  }
                }
              },
              "else": {
                "actions": {}
              }
            },
            "Fail_the_run": {
              "type": "Terminate",
              "runAfter": {
                "Did_it_fail": [
                  "Succeeded",
                  "Failed",
                  "TimedOut"
                ]
              },
              "inputs": {
                "runStatus": "Failed",
                "runError": {
                  "code": "SweepFailed",
                  "message": "The agent invocation or response validation failed. Work may have executed; review run history and target state before retrying."
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "outputs": {}
        },
        "parameters": {}
      }
    }
  ],
  "outputs": {
    "principalId": {
      "type": "string",
      "value": "[reference(resourceId('Microsoft.Logic/workflows', parameters('name')), '2019-05-01', 'full').identity.principalId]"
    }
  }
}
